# Docs & Workflow

## Source of truth

| Layer | Role |
|-------|------|
| **`docs/PIVOT_PLAN.md`** | **Active pivot** — phase checklist, progress, file touch map |
| **`docs/DATASET_PLATFORM.md`** | **Active product** — pipeline, schema templates, terminology |
| **Linear** (`EventForge` project) | Issue tracking when pivot issues exist |
| `docs/TASKS.md` | **Legacy** roadmap mirror (Phases 0–6 research/AWS) |
| `docs/LINEAR.md` | **Legacy** issue index (Phases 0–5) |
| `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Agent conventions |
| `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` | Pipeline diagrams (**legacy** until Phase 10 rewrite) |

## Session start

1. Read `docs/PIVOT_PLAN.md` progress table for current phase
2. Optional: Linear MCP `list_issues(project: EventForge)` for tracked issues
3. Read acceptance criteria + relevant `.cursor/rules/`

## On pivot phase complete

1. Check boxes in `docs/PIVOT_PLAN.md`
2. Update ADRs only if architecture changed
3. Legacy: mark Done in Linear + check `docs/TASKS.md` if issue maps to old phases

## Doc roles

| File | When to read |
|------|--------------|
| `docs/DATASET_PLATFORM.md` | **Pivot:** target product, terminology, success criteria |
| `docs/PIVOT_PLAN.md` | **Pivot:** phase checklist, progress, file touch map |
| `docs/LINEAR.md` | Legacy issue index (Phases 0–5) — archived |
| `docs/TASKS.md` | Legacy phase progress (Phases 0–6) — archived |
| `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` | Pipeline diagrams (legacy until pivot Phase 10) |
| `docs/TECH_DECISIONS.md` | ADR-014 pivot + stack decisions |
| `docs/PRD.md` | Product scope (legacy until pivot Phase 10) |
| `docs/CICD.md` | Active CI + archived AWS deploy reference |
| `docs/ISSUES.md` | Postmortems — append after non-trivial infra/CI/debug fixes (placeholders only, no secrets) |

## On non-trivial bug fix

After resolving a production-style issue (Terraform thrash, CI OIDC, hung apply, etc.):

1. Add a STAR entry to `docs/ISSUES.md` using the template at the bottom
2. Use placeholders — never real account IDs, ARNs, API keys, or secret contents
3. Link file paths and error messages; point to `docs/CICD.md` for historical CI/deploy setup

## Phase exit criteria

Follow `docs/PIVOT_PLAN.md` for pivot phases. Legacy Phases 0–6 are complete — do not use `docs/TASKS.md` for new work.
